 "queue": "security",
 "summary": "URGENT - possible data theft. Priya Raman (E004, Sales Director) reports that Diego Alvarez (E017, manager) caught Hannah Wright (E018, Sales Development Rep, Sales, Chicago, active) exporting the entire customer list to a personal gmail account last night (2026-11-16). Hannah is being terminated today (2026-11-17). Requester asks for her access to be cut immediately. Per POL-OFF-02 the helpdesk cannot start involuntary offboarding; please act on immediate access suspension (email, chat, hr_portal, crm currently listed) and preserve evidence of the export. HR has been notified separately for the termination itself."
}

{
 "queue": "hr",
 "summary": "Termination today (2026-11-17) of Hannah Wright (E018, Sales Development Rep, Sales, Chicago). Requested by Priya Raman (E004, Sales Director); manager Diego Alvarez (E017) reportedly caught Hannah exporting the entire customer list to a personal gmail account on 2026-11-16. Per POL-OFF-02, involuntary exits are handled by HR, who coordinate timing of access removal. Security has also been escalated because of the data-theft risk. Please handle the termination and access removal timing. Helpdesk has not started offboarding."
}

{
 "kind": "escalated",
 "message": "Priya, I can't start an immediate lockout myself. Terminations and other involuntary exits are handled by HR only, and the helpdesk doesn't start offboarding for them (POL-OFF-02). Because this involves a possible data theft, the policy says to escalate to Security at once, so I've done that:\n\n- Security (ticket ESC-1001): urgent request to suspend Hannah Wright's access now (her directory record shows email, chat, hr_portal and crm) and to preserve evidence of the export to her personal gmail.\n- HR (ticket ESC-1002): the termination for today, and coordination of the timing of access removal.\n\nPlease also contact Security and HR directly by phone so the access cut-off isn't waiting on the queue. I haven't filed or changed anything else on Hannah's account.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-02"
 ]
}
